    <!-- Domains tab -->
    <string name="domains_help">Your own rules for ordinary websites, separate from the tracker lists. A rule covers the domain and everything under it, so blocking google.com also blocks www.google.com and mail.google.com. The more specific rule wins, so you can block a domain and allow one name inside it. Rules take effect at once, for every app set to Filtered.</string>
